  "$validation": "Workflow's `timezone` column must equal one of the keys in `mapping` (i.e. one of `friendly_names`). Validated by `validates :timezone, inclusion: ActiveSupport::TimeZone.all.map(&:name)` (workflow/rails/app/models/workflow/setup.rb L32). At runtime, Rails resolves the friendly name to the IANA value via `ActiveSupport::TimeZone.find_tzinfo(name).name` and appends it to the Rufus cron string (workflow/rails/app/models/workflow.rb L335-336).",
